            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.41

- Captures previous and next cover URLs in the normal YouTube Music metadata poll.
- Removes the separate Chrome-request race that could leave swipe previews empty.
- Allows artwork resolving just after finger release to finish the committed transition.
- Retains player-playlist, queue-store, and visible-row extraction as layered fallbacks.
]]></description>
